wardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-11T17:34:56","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c08f37be-0b6e-45fe-b075-23c416147330","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561276799,"PostDateInt":1784707721000,"PostDate":"2026-07-22T16:08:41","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"数字系统验证工程师（FPGA）(J12715)","OrgId":1584378,"Org":"验证组","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 芯片定义阶段协助进行芯片规格的需求分析；\r\n2. 理解芯片架构和内部模块功能，设计验证方案和计划；\r\n3. 硅前进行仿真验证环境搭建，开发测试用例，对各模块裸机/Linux/FreeRTOS等开发验证驱动，开发Bootrom，基于FPGA/Palladium等进行仿真验证，完成验证报告；\r\n4. 硅后基于EVB/Demo/SLT/HQA板进行IC模块和系统的功能/性能/带宽/功耗等验证，并协助硬件进行HQA测试；\r\n5. 搭建SLT封测软件环境，设计验证用例，SLT产线环境部署和软件更新迭代支持；\r\n6. 支持系统软件开发和客户问题分析解决；\r\n7. 支持客退IC问题分析。","Require":"1. 计算机、微电子等相关专业，本科毕业3年，硕士毕业2年；\r\n2. 熟悉软硬件协同测试开发的常用编程语言、脚本语言及相关操作系统的知识，如C/Python/Shell语言，Linux/Android/RTOS等操作系统； \r\n3. 熟悉软硬件测试开发相关的仪器设备平台/测试环境和工具；\r\n4. 熟悉一种或者多种芯片片上构件（如CPU/常用总线/接口协议/HSM/Flash等）的知识；\r\n5. 熟悉车规芯片安全相关标准ISO26262、ISO21434，及MCU软件框架Autosar和Aspice认证流程\r\n6. 能熟练使用英语进行读写；\r\n7. 注重团队合作. 具备抗压能力；\r\n8. 有芯片验证相关经验者优先；","ClassificationOn